#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:3
#: 51ccffae89484ddda6dd028a1bdc1c86
msgid "磁有序初始化（Magnetic Order）"
msgstr "Magnetic-Order Initialization (Magnetic Order)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:5
#: d869e832f9214d0983705419131d9f7a
msgid "`Group`: `Magnetism` | `Class`: `MagneticOrderCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:7
#: 7964749823f84189b7851b9eb52c9a5b
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:9
#: ce5d4b192be045c6bcf0d4b79fbf3e83
msgid ""
"从一个磁性母相结构出发，一次性生成 FM（铁磁）、AFM（反铁磁）、PM（顺磁）多种磁序分支。每个输出结构都写入对应的 "
"`initial_magmoms` 数组和 `Config_type` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"Branch one magnetic parent structure into ferromagnetic (FM), "
"antiferromagnetic (AFM), and paramagnetic-like (PM) initial states. Every "
"output receives the corresponding `initial_magmoms` array and a "
"`Config_type` label."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:11
#: bced2ea56edb474ca20970076b5a19bf
msgid "**关键限制：** 这张卡只写入初始磁矩，不保证生成的就是磁基态。磁矩是否收敛到合理值仍需要用 NEP/DFT 后续计算验证。"
msgstr ""
"**Important limitation:** This card assigns initial moments; it does not "
"determine a magnetic ground state. Whether a state converges to a physically"
" meaningful solution must be established by the subsequent NEP or DFT "
"calculation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:13
#: b09833a9cd1149bca550c12bb949ba8e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:15
#: c92b1cc74e5b48eeb1e8a5eab61e56fb
msgid "场景：FM 模型在 AFM 相上预测崩了"
msgstr "Scenario: an FM-trained model fails on an AFM state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:17
#: 3e6eef6b4288472da18d1291e6c5a47a
msgid ""
"你在 bcc Fe 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，所有训练数据来自 FM 构型。模型对铁磁态的能量和力预测很好，但一跑 AFM 构型，能量误差是 FM 的"
" 5 倍。诊断结果是：训练集里只有一种磁序，模型把\"所有磁矩同向\"当成了默认假设，碰到磁矩翻转的结构只能瞎猜。"
msgstr ""
"You trained an NEP model for bcc Fe using only FM configurations. It "
"predicts FM energies and forces accurately, but its energy error on AFM "
"configurations is five times larger. The training set contains only one "
"order, so reversed local moments lie outside the magnetic environments the "
"model has learned."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:19
#: 4bdbddb3b3c548ed9fb34180bab966cf
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 磁性体系的训练集至少应该覆盖 FM 和 AFM 两种极端磁序，如果体系可能有顺磁相，PM "
"也要加。不同磁序下，同一种原子的局域磁环境完全不同——模型需要见过这些环境才能泛化。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** A magnetic training set should cover the ordered states "
"relevant to the material, commonly including FM and one or more AFM "
"patterns. If disordered local moments are relevant, add paramagnetic-like "
"samples as well. The same atom can have very different local magnetic "
"environments under these orders, and the model must see them before it can "
"interpolate between them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:21
#: db6a86ccc65f480a805315cad965e5ed
msgid "**输入：** 一个含 Fe 的 bcc 晶体，已知 Fe 的磁矩约 2.2 μB（来自 DFT 或文献）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A bcc Fe crystal with an Fe reference moment of approximately 2.2"
" μB from DFT or literature."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:23
#: 72da80c7c6e2414b9a237bd27d7c99f7
msgid "**目标：** 从一个结构出发，生成 1 个 FM + 1 个 AFM（k-vector 111）+ 8 个 PM，共 10 个不同磁序的训练样本"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** From one structure, generate one FM state, one AFM state with "
"k-vector 111, and eight PM-like states, for ten magnetic initializations in "
"total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:25
#: 80fbc30f19574049b90c07588553db70
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:26
#: 682f6779b0bd4002a85b63c43dbae622
msgid "`Format` = `Collinear (scalar)` （先从不共线开始，复杂度低）"
msgstr ""
"`Format` = `Collinear (scalar)` (start with the lower-complexity collinear "
"representation)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:27
#: a02fe6a401c94d33acf46b13e968a23e
msgid "`Magmom Map` = `Fe:2.2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:28
#: 5f5031d0ae1342a386590c4e9df9b3b0
msgid "`Gen FM` = 勾选，`Gen AFM` = 勾选"
msgstr "Enable `Gen FM` and `Gen AFM`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:29
#: 4227cf09d9ed4a5e95aebd13d927390e
msgid "`AFM Mode` = `k-vector`，`AFM Kvec` = `111`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:30
#: 99907b5a308b47e297172d73cd0bc044
msgid "`Gen PM` = 勾选，`PM Count` = `[8]`"
msgstr "Enable `Gen PM` and set `PM Count` to `[8]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:32
#: 055c72cd1866453c8e1f96d7beedea8a
msgid "**输出：** 1 个 FM + 1 个 AFM + 8 个 PM，全部带 `initial_magmoms` 和对应的 `Config_type` 标签"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** One FM, one AFM, and eight PM-like structures, all with "
"`initial_magmoms` and matching `Config_type` labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:34
#: 50e6326d8d02450394df66e5345f14a4
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:35
#: 939d98757aa44c27a42f6b16fe94fb13
msgid "重训后用这组数据里的 FM 和 AFM 分别做推理，能量误差差异应该显著缩小"
msgstr ""
"After DFT labeling and retraining, compare held-out FM and AFM errors; the "
"large order-dependent gap should decrease."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:36
#: 60dac9ff6a954f1ea0a2f7523c45542b
msgid "抽查 FM/AFM 的 `initial_magmoms`：FM 全正、AFM 在 111 方向上相邻层符号翻转"
msgstr ""
"Inspect `initial_magmoms`: FM moments should share one sign, while the 111 "
"AFM pattern should alternate signs between adjacent layers along that phase "
"direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:37
#: 60326dc8424c482ca9b30f5792257227
msgid "如果 AFM 效果仍差，换 `AFM Kvec` = `110` 或 `100`，覆盖不同翻转周期"
msgstr ""
"If AFM behavior remains poor, test physically relevant `AFM Kvec` values "
"such as `110` or `100` to cover different alternation patterns."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:38
#: f9f34f8bfb6048d0937478202325f09f
msgid "如果 PM 结构能量分布异常宽，可能是磁矩幅值设置不合理——检查 `magmom_map` 或 `default_moment`"
msgstr ""
"If PM-like energies span an implausibly wide range, verify the magnitudes in"
" `magmom_map` and `default_moment` before generating more samples."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:40
#: 578cb9123b524c2e9e30d2688f41f119
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:42
#: 45331cb244e24c0882b97be27211002f
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:43
#: dbdbb6ddca6e44d2ac4f48ab83a5d64f
msgid "模型在不同磁序之间泛化差（FM 推理好、AFM 崩）"
msgstr ""
"The model transfers poorly between magnetic orders, for example succeeding "
"on FM but failing on AFM."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:44
#: 6217b3fcaa234ecdbcba68728973327f
msgid "研究体系本身存在多种磁有序相（如 Fe、NiO、钙钛矿磁性材料）"
msgstr ""
"The material supports several relevant magnetic orders, as in Fe, NiO, or "
"magnetic perovskites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:45
#: 519a359fe7434a1797ee55118908e13f
msgid "需要模型能区分磁基态和激发态"
msgstr "The model must distinguish magnetic ground and excited states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:47
#: 59f891246d1f43ce9b637114d85506d3
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:48
#: 0a1b6751c7de4d7faadbc56a2d365821
msgid "体系是非磁的（纯 Si、Al 等），加了只会引入无意义的磁矩标签"
msgstr ""
"The system is nonmagnetic, such as elemental Si or Al; moment labels would "
"be meaningless."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:49
#: 552f8535f8cf48d2af16ca37c1d7201e
msgid "只需要静态磁矩初始化，不需要多磁序分支（用 `Set Magnetic Moments`）"
msgstr ""
"Only one moment initialization is needed, without magnetic-order branches → "
"use `Set Magnetic Moments`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:51
#: 0a5a4b01bb514ebab782629965796bb8
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:53
#: 7f4c18ab2ce742a281625b393f8bc33d
msgid "磁矩格式和幅值"
msgstr "Moment representation and magnitude"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:55
#: 68ef3f05a86e4484ab61a42c2ef65f31
msgid "先把\"磁矩写多大、什么格式\"定下来，后面 FM/AFM/PM 分支都在这个基础上操作。"
msgstr ""
"First define moment magnitudes and representation. All FM, AFM, and PM-like "
"branches are built from this common reference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:57
#: 890c3d33e40d4b589a4cb9c438761125
msgid "Format（format）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:59
#: eb93e829751844dbbc3e3ce480c691ef
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Collinear (scalar)`。`Collinear` = 每个原子只有一个标量 ± 磁矩，沿 `Axis` 方向"
"；`Non-collinear` = 每个原子一个 3D 矢量。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `Collinear (scalar)`. `Collinear` stores one signed scalar "
"per atom along `Axis`; `Non-collinear` stores a three-component vector per "
"atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:61
#: 3c3627a617e2407793d24e1564ff55d0
msgid "大多数共线磁序用标量就够了，简单且训练数据量小。如果你后续要做非共线螺旋、canting 或 DMI 相关训练，这里必须先切成矢量模式。"
msgstr ""
"Scalar moments are sufficient for collinear orders and keep the data "
"representation simple. Select vectors before downstream noncollinear "
"spirals, canting, or DMI-related workflows."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:63
#: 8d3c6184e01a4035a60cabb02ae20778
msgid "Axis（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:65
#: 138639a0bf4642d0a286eff60d47babc
msgid "`[x, y, z]`，默认 `[0, 0, 1]`（z 轴）。共线模式下磁矩沿这个方向；非共线模式下 FM/AFM 的默认方向也以它为参考。"
msgstr ""
"`[x, y, z]`, default: `[0, 0, 1]`. Reference direction for collinear moments"
" and for the default FM/AFM direction in noncollinear mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:67
#: 681f9131212648de8d1ddc905d3e26dc
msgid "改它之前先确认结构的晶胞取向——如果你的 slab 法向是 z，通常保持默认；如果研究面内各向异性，可能要改到 x 或 y。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm the cell orientation before changing it. For a slab normal to *z*, "
"the default may be appropriate; an in-plane anisotropy study may require *x*"
" or *y*."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:69
#: 97c1f2e56ed04a51b4476416b0676f55
msgid "Magmom Map（magmom_map）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:71
#: 8321a3bac28d40dab7eb3bd79ac7d34a
msgid "`str`，默认空。`Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6` 这种格式，显式指定每个元素的磁矩大小。这是你最精确的控制方式——用已知的 DFT 或文献值填。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: empty. Explicit element magnitudes such as `Fe:2.2, Ni:0.6`."
" Use defensible values from DFT, experiment, or literature."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:73
#: e310ffa284244c2fad33d9118531ee1b
msgid "Use Element Dirs（use_element_dirs）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:75
#: 992a69ed2d884404a3f4de7eb9c4d5ba
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。打开后不同元素可以有不同的磁矩方向（从 `magmom_map` 中读取方向信息），而不是全沿 "
"`Axis`。非共线多元素体系（比如 Fe↑ Mn↓）才会用到。标量模式下不需要开。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Preserve element-specific vector directions from "
"`magmom_map` instead of aligning every moment with `Axis`. This is relevant "
"to multielement noncollinear systems and has no effect in scalar mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:77
#: 9983eb4c8375408ea3008445b00b74c4
msgid "Default Moment（default_moment）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:79
#: 41cac059cda74b44ac511b8a0c91fbb8
msgid "`float`，默认 0.0。没在 `magmom_map` 里列出的元素统一用这个值。设 0 意味着非磁性元素不写磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.0`. Magnitude assigned to elements absent from "
"`magmom_map`. Zero leaves unconfigured species without a moment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:81
#: 52b8d7372f544d638c2f45fcc2afaa1e
msgid "Apply Elements（apply_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:83
#: 2c6c097abde74d5cb2b6df237497bb38
msgid "`str`，默认空（全部生效）。逗号分隔如 `Fe, Co`。只给这些元素写磁矩，其他的写 0。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: empty, meaning all elements. A comma-separated list such as "
"`Fe, Co` restricts moments to those species; all others receive zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:85
#: dc4b85e4b5de4da7a6c6e6229e8053ff
msgid ""
"优先级：`magmom_map` 命中的 → 用映射值；没命中但被 `apply_elements` 包含的 → 用 "
"`default_moment`；都不在的 → 写 0。"
msgstr ""
"Precedence: an element found in `magmom_map` uses the mapped value; an "
"unmatched element included by `apply_elements` uses `default_moment`; all "
"others receive zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:87
#: 5afebe75119a4dcf961c22b449abf910
msgid "FM / AFM 分支"
msgstr "FM and AFM branches"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:89
#: d9b34d32dd3d4f6cb7ce0950ff98c3d4
msgid "这两张复选框决定输出里有没有铁磁和反铁磁构型。通常至少保留 FM ——它是一个重要的能量参考态。"
msgstr ""
"These options control whether FM and AFM initializations are produced. "
"Retain FM when it is a relevant reference state for the material."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:91
#: dfc7a30ddf144571adbc9d9e52a3979c
msgid "Gen FM（gen_fm）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:93
#: a526d165b92e4a6eb9554c8a7d9b2c5a
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开 → 输出一个铁磁结构（所有磁矩同向）。关掉它意味着你只要 AFM/PM，比较少见。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `true`. Produce one FM structure with all target moments "
"parallel."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:95
#: ac070eace8e6452b948e64ab0e2d79ee
msgid "Gen AFM（gen_afm）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:97
#: 9ae9080ae1c94053861025f74d9a554c
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开 → 输出反铁磁结构。需要选一种 AFM 构造方式："
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `true`. Produce an AFM structure using one of the following"
" construction methods."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:99
#: 84ae9ecf2e3c43b18b9b481c57f715f9
msgid "AFM Mode（afm_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:101
#: 53d6042e0f8f4c159e608366383de983
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `k-vector`。`k-vector` 用波矢自动翻转——简单、不需要上游准备。`group A/B` 用手动标注的 group "
"标签决定正负——更灵活，但需要先用 `Group Label` 卡打好标签。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `k-vector`. `k-vector` assigns alternating signs from a "
"phase pattern without upstream labels. `group A/B` assigns signs from "
"explicit `group` labels and requires a preceding `Group Label` card."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:103
#: efcdb0902fe146219eab40cf8082ae40
msgid ""
"你很可能先从 k-vector 试起。只有当你发现 k-vector 的翻转面切到了不等价原子（比如 NiO 里 Ni 和 O "
"两种子晶格被混在一起了），再切到 group A/B。"
msgstr ""
"Start with k-vector for a simple periodic pattern. Switch to group A/B when "
"the desired magnetic sublattices cannot be represented by a geometric phase "
"alone, such as when inequivalent species must be treated separately."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:105
#: c8985f1fa857432684fa024c2cf0a2db
msgid "AFM Kvec（afm_kvec）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:107
#: e94aa44b4b084411aea563c3f2c3ee88
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `111`。仅 k-vector 模式。`100` / `010` / `001` / `110` / "
"`111`。沿这个方向相邻原子层磁矩正负交替。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `111`. Used only in k-vector mode. Choices are `100`, `010`,"
" `001`, `110`, and `111`; the sign alternates according to the corresponding"
" layer phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:109
#: 40c8a4be09464dfc955edaefa5b2e49a
msgid "AFM Group A（afm_group_a）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:111
#: 0c9dfa3bc89f4af29dbd8c55d5b26a99
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `A`。仅 group A/B 模式。`atoms.arrays['group']` 中等于这个标签的原子取正号磁矩。它必须和上游 "
"`Group Label` 卡写入的标签完全一致，包括大小写。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `A`. Used only in group A/B mode. Atoms whose "
"`atoms.arrays['group']` equals this case-sensitive label receive positive "
"moments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:113
#: e4d555c89890437980f91b62392d9351
msgid "AFM Group B（afm_group_b）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:115
#: d173dfa6905440a8b15ae76b1ed3d799
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `B`。仅 group A/B 模式。`atoms.arrays['group']` 中等于这个标签的原子取负号磁矩。通常和 "
"`afm_group_a` 成对使用，用来显式指定两套反平行子晶格。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `B`. Used only in group A/B mode. Atoms with this case-"
"sensitive group label receive negative moments, defining the sublattice "
"antiparallel to `afm_group_a`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:117
#: 52ec7ffe2dde40559c7fe8e0c34efe50
msgid "AFM Zero Unknown（afm_zero_unknown）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:119
#: bc47e975ab3d4bf296d449f86ae30873
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。仅 group A/B 模式。打开 → 不属于 A 也不属于 B 的原子磁矩置零。关掉 → 这些原子默认为正。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `true`. In group A/B mode, set moments outside groups A and"
" B to zero. When disabled, unmatched target atoms default to the positive "
"sign."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:121
#: 1c8e546bf93743a9bb43ca80e0985106
msgid "PM 分支"
msgstr "PM-like branch"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:123
#: 7cc4d5c35cfb47878777c386afdd5b9c
msgid "PM 生成大量随机磁序样本。默认关闭的——因为开了输出数量会乘上 `pm_count + 2`。"
msgstr ""
"The PM-like branch creates random moment directions and is disabled by "
"default because it can increase the output count by `pm_count` in addition "
"to the FM and AFM branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:125
#: e505f09565d44809b9995cb2373f84b8
msgid "Gen PM（gen_pm）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:127
#: 6a3dff5bdbdf4eae80a25549cca1cf24
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后才生成顺磁构型。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enable to generate paramagnetic-like initial "
"states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:129
#: d9c0825aaf9a4a589e7071c07dddc660
msgid "PM Count（pm_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:131
#: 0e5102a2337142bfa3b2de1be7701ae9
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 10。生成几个 PM 样本。5-10 覆盖基本无序态，20+ 做统计训练。注意每帧输出 = 1 FM（如果开了）+ 1 "
"AFM（如果开了）+ `pm_count` 个 PM。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `10`. Number of PM-like samples. Use 5–10 for basic disorder"
" coverage and 20 or more for statistical sampling. Per-frame output equals "
"the enabled FM branch plus the enabled AFM branch plus `pm_count`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:133
#: 63546ec2c264477f9cbf642041f7eea3
msgid "PM Direction（pm_direction）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:135
#: 5b04ebb8e497435a838c3b0846cbc18e
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `sphere`。`sphere` — 磁矩方向在球面上均匀撒。`cone` — 限制在以 `Axis` 为中心的锥面内，锥角由下面的"
" `PM Cone Angle` 控制。如果你要模拟有限温度下自旋偏离平衡方向不太远的情况，用 cone；要模拟完全无序的顺磁态，用 sphere。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `sphere`. `sphere` samples directions uniformly over the "
"sphere. `cone` limits them to a cone around `Axis`, with the opening "
"controlled by `PM Cone Angle`. Use a cone for finite-temperature "
"fluctuations near a reference direction and a sphere for fully disordered "
"orientations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:137
#: e464859d48934f8aa5d52eb987ae2924
msgid "PM Cone Angle（pm_cone_angle）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:139
#: 2d0c5ed3364747caa025e345bd7437ef
msgid "`float`，默认 30°。仅 cone 模式。偏离 `Axis` 的最大角度。30° 表示有限温近平衡扰动，60° 接近强无序。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `30`°. Maximum deviation from `Axis` in cone mode. Around "
"30° represents moderate directional disorder; 60° is much broader."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:141
#: 9d87ac1b3463421ba1f90e5b4590a2b5
msgid "PM Balanced（pm_balanced）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:143
#: 2413b440fea84c24b5d7b7dad1c2f2fc
msgid "`bool`，默认 true。打开后正负方向数量尽量平衡。一般建议保持——不勾的话可能出现某一方向系统性偏多。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `true`. Balance opposite directions as closely as possible "
"to reduce an accidental net orientation bias."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:145
#: 38044c7e383047169e175a5f39df9ab6
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:147
#: 06c7e86465a54a3ba1b847ff90a75c2a
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:149
#: b19928e27578480a9f23f8f1e65a1283
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定随机种子 → 同参数同输入可复现。对比实验时开，纯探索可以关。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default: `false`. Enable with a fixed seed for reproducibility. Use "
"it for comparisons; it can remain disabled during exploration."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:151
#: a0f219bdef314c03821ff73400d3919a
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:153
#: 33cff0ff74e64d7dbda5a9665faf65c9
msgid "`int`，默认 0。仅在 `use_seed` 打开时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default: `0`. Used only when `use_seed` is enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:155
#: 9912db69268e4a2f88d6124a14e26c70
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:157
#: e51dfcbbb161459f9a2a1d2f808c2b8c
msgid "FM + AFM 基础集（2 个输出，快速验证用）"
msgstr "Basic FM + AFM set (2 outputs for a quick check)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:158
#: e6eeff0c1dfb4559bc46f58df886b51e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"format\": \"Collinear (scalar)\",\n"
"  \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"  \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2\",\n"
"  \"default_moment\": [0.0],\n"
"  \"apply_elements\": \"Fe\",\n"
"  \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"  \"gen_afm\": true,\n"
"  \"afm_mode\": \"k-vector\",\n"
"  \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"  \"gen_pm\": false,\n"
"  \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"  \"seed\": [42]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:177
#: dadc90e74c2f4d71bd1a16b819cd058d
msgid "FM + AFM + PM 全磁序（~12 个输出，常规训练用）"
msgstr "FM + AFM + PM-like coverage (~12 outputs for routine training)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:178
#: 0f3184954ca140b180da35a5268cb158
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"format\": \"Collinear (scalar)\",\n"
"  \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"  \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6\",\n"
"  \"default_moment\": [0.0],\n"
"  \"apply_elements\": \"\",\n"
"  \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"  \"gen_afm\": true,\n"
"  \"afm_mode\": \"k-vector\",\n"
"  \"afm_kvec\": \"111\",\n"
"  \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"  \"pm_count\": [10],\n"
"  \"pm_direction\": \"sphere\",\n"
"  \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"  \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"  \"seed\": [42]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:200
#: bc6ff8ecfd884e1fb8c05785a03a037f
msgid "非共线多磁序（~17 个输出，研究级）"
msgstr "Noncollinear multiple-order coverage (~17 outputs; research scale)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:201
#: 6d16dd4aca7747e398acf78d7e508d93
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"MagneticOrderCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"format\": \"Non-collinear (vector)\",\n"
"  \"axis\": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0],\n"
"  \"magmom_map\": \"Fe:2.2,Cr:1.5\",\n"
"  \"default_moment\": [0.5],\n"
"  \"apply_elements\": \"Fe,Cr,Mn\",\n"
"  \"gen_fm\": true,\n"
"  \"gen_afm\": true,\n"
"  \"afm_mode\": \"k-vector\",\n"
"  \"afm_kvec\": \"110\",\n"
"  \"gen_pm\": true,\n"
"  \"pm_count\": [15],\n"
"  \"pm_direction\": \"cone\",\n"
"  \"pm_cone_angle\": [45.0],\n"
"  \"pm_balanced\": true,\n"
"  \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"  \"seed\": [42]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:224
#: 521c1ec1f5264d46bcac6b14fdda0849
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:226
#: 1c6e1947c3644c539e3034f468ea79ba
msgid "`Group Label` → `Magnetic Order`：先打 group 标签，再用 group A/B 模式生成细粒度 AFM"
msgstr ""
"`Group Label` → `Magnetic Order`: label magnetic sublattices, then construct"
" an explicit AFM pattern with group A/B mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:227
#: 8d76a3adb66f493dbcb066d5faa29744
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Magmom Rotation`：基础磁序 → 小角度旋转补样"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Magmom Rotation`: generate reference orders, then sample"
" small-angle neighborhoods."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:228
#: 327d95db60b2499cafa336e79333dc73
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`：磁序初始化幅值 → 螺旋调制"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Spin Spiral`: initialize moment magnitudes, then impose "
"a spiral modulation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:230
#: 09d679c2d8c64489bb50ca62666fe6d1
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:232
#: 80251ce8008b4c0c934f6bcf748911f6
msgid ""
"**输出没有磁矩。** `magmom_map` 和 `default_moment` 是否都为空/0？`apply_elements` "
"是否过滤掉了所有有磁矩的元素？"
msgstr ""
"**The output has no moments.** Check whether both `magmom_map` and "
"`default_moment` are empty or zero, and whether `apply_elements` excludes "
"every magnetic species."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:234
#: a1908cc9bc114b83a4a5b375a21feacd
msgid ""
"**AFM 没翻转。** 如果用 `group A/B` 模式，检查输入是否有 `atoms.arrays['group']` 且包含 A/B "
"标签。没有的话换 `k-vector` 模式。"
msgstr ""
"**AFM moments do not alternate.** In group A/B mode, confirm that "
"`atoms.arrays['group']` exists and contains the exact A and B labels. "
"Otherwise add upstream group labels or switch to k-vector mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:236
#: 31731971a906401eb60415523d82f274
msgid "**PM 没生成。** `gen_pm` 默认关闭，确认已勾选。"
msgstr ""
"**No PM-like structures are produced.** `gen_pm` is disabled by default; "
"enable it explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:238
#: 788b7c10569b48f390cad464c2d942d2
msgid ""
"**非共线磁矩方向不符合预期。** 检查 `Axis` 是否正确。非共线 FM/AFM 模式下，每个原子的磁矩方向沿 `Axis`，只有 PM "
"才会随机偏离。"
msgstr ""
"**Noncollinear directions are not as expected.** Check `Axis`. In the "
"default noncollinear FM/AFM branches, target moments follow `Axis`; only PM-"
"like states are randomly deflected."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:240
#: 6d6aa3c262f34b5ba0fa68eaec6073b1
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:242
#: 8f92b90cbad540a8af0410cd9bbfb7c7
msgid "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`：铁磁（共线/非共线）"
msgstr "`MagFM` / `MagFMnc`: collinear / noncollinear ferromagnetic state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:243
#: 8926761342aa466b9c173b42f8a7de46
msgid "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM110`：反铁磁，后缀为 k-vector"
msgstr "`MagAFM111` / `MagAFM110`: antiferromagnetic state with the k-vector suffix"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:244
#: ec368f0fa25341dfa4bd9a3c7123d919
msgid "`MagAFMg`：group A/B 模式反铁磁"
msgstr "`MagAFMg`: group A/B antiferromagnetic state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:245
#: 39c4b8a5d4e34414a00da8fa176554e2
msgid "`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`：顺磁，可能带 seed 后缀"
msgstr "`MagPM` / `MagPMnc`: paramagnetic-like state, possibly with a seed suffix"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:247
#: c31574a9c84342bfb4931f287b990bf9
msgid "所有输出写入 `initial_magmoms` 数组。"
msgstr "All outputs are written to the `initial_magmoms` array."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:249
#: 757b0012099d49c1a25b4621af5712b5
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/magnetic-order-card.md:251
#: 509cfb47c41246b4bfcf12ef6537475c
msgid "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。PM 随机性受 seed + 结构稳定 ID 联合控制。"
msgstr ""
"Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce the same result for the same "
"input. PM-like randomness is determined jointly by the seed and the "
"structure's stable ID."
